      "description": "Pull genuine trading cards from your phone. Build your collection or have the real card shipped home.\n\nCrownCards is a digital pack-opening experience built around real collectibles. Every card in every pack is a genuine trading card, from popular TCG singles to graded slabs and rare chase cards. Every card's market value is listed before you open. No mystery about what a pull is worth: just the thrill of the reveal, and your choice of what to do next.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Pick a pack. Browse packs with clearly labelled card pools, rarity tiers, value ranges and pull rates. Pick the one that matches the card you're chasing.\n\n2. Open and reveal. Watch each card turn one by one. You might pull everyday collectibles, sought-after singles, professionally graded slabs or a rare hit.\n\n3. Decide card by card. Two options for every card you pull:\n- Collect it: keep it in your in-app collection\n- Ship it: request delivery of the real card\n\nREAL CARDS, REAL VALUES\n\nEvery card in CrownCards is a genuine, physical collectible. Listed values are tied to market data, so you know exactly what you pulled and what it's worth in the wider collecting market.\n\nPHYSICAL SHIPPING\n\nWant to hold the real thing? Request delivery and we'll ship your chosen cards to your address with secure, tracked handling.",
